              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-3xl font-black text-white">3 g</p>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1">Creatine monohydrate</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-3xl font-black text-[#38BDF8]">$2.52</p>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1">Per 25 g protein (Amazon)</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Picks -->
        <div id="top-picks" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">
            2. Transparent Labs Mass Gainer and the Gainers to Compare
          </h2>

          <p>
            The product reviewed, the three big gainers people weigh it against, and the Transparent Labs whey for anyone who needs protein more than calories. Prices are what we saw on Amazon on 20 November 2026 and change often; cost per 25 g is price divided by (servings times protein per serving divided by 25).
          </p>

