            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary><h3>Does Transparent Labs Mass Gainer contain lactose, casein or artificial sweeteners?</h3></summary>
              <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>
                  It contains whey protein concentrate, which carries some lactose, and sodium caseinate inside the MCT oil powder, so it is not lactose-free or casein-free. It contains no artificial sweeteners, per the label; it is sweetened with stevia extract. The allergen statement lists milk and coconut, plus peanuts in Chocolate Peanut Butter.
                </p>
