                  The most common complaints in buyer reviews are flavor fatigue after weeks of daily use, Sweet Vanilla being too sweet, occasional clumping in a shaker, a scoop that sinks into the powder and accidental subscription sign-ups. From the label, the price is the biggest drawback: 15 servings for $79.99 means a daily user buys two tubs a month.
